WEBVTT

00:15:28.836 --> 00:15:30.858
that you know are going to ease you off

00:15:30.882 --> 00:15:33.560
into the honey-heavy dew of slumber.

00:15:34.195 --> 00:15:35.354
OK.

00:15:35.378 --> 00:15:37.680
That's some facts. What about some myths?

00:15:37.704 --> 00:15:38.986
Teenagers are lazy.

00:15:39.010 --> 00:15:40.874
No. Poor things.

00:15:40.898 --> 00:15:44.324
They have a biological predisposition
to go to bed late and get up late,

00:15:44.348 --> 00:15:45.637
so give them a break.

00:15:45.661 --> 00:15:48.541
We need eight hours of sleep a night.

00:15:49.392 --> 00:15:50.548
That's an average.

00:15:50.572 --> 00:15:52.840
Some people need more.
Some people need less.

00:15:52.864 --> 00:15:55.077
And what you need to do
is listen to your body.

00:15:55.101 --> 00:15:57.442
Do you need that much or do you need more?

00:15:57.466 --> 00:15:58.842
Simple as that.

00:15:58.866 --> 00:16:00.986
Old people need less sleep.